#: ../../gas_laws/argon_molar_volume.rst:3
msgid "気体1 molはなぜ22.4 Lなのか？"
msgstr "Why Does One Mole of Gas Occupy 22.4 L?"

#: ../../gas_laws/argon_molar_volume.rst:5
msgid ""
"高校の化学では「0 ℃、1気圧で、気体1 molの体積は約22.4 L」と習います。\\ 1 "
"molには約6.02×10²³個もの粒子があります。\\ 粒子が動き回る気体に、なぜ決まった体積があるのでしょうか。"
msgstr ""
"In high school chemistry, we learn that at 0 °C and 1 atm, one mole of "
"gas occupies about 22.4 L. \\ One mole contains about 6.02×10²³ "
"particles. \\ Why does a gas whose particles are constantly moving have a"
" definite volume?"

#: ../../gas_laws/argon_molar_volume.rst:9
msgid ""
"ここではアルゴン（Ar）原子を1,000個だけ用意し、箱の大きさを変えたときの圧力を計算します。\\ "
"その結果から、1気圧に対応するモル体積を求めてみましょう。\\ 使うのは、原子の運動を追う分子動力学（MD）という方法です。"
msgstr ""
"We use just 1,000 argon (Ar) atoms to calculate the pressure at different"
" box sizes. \\ Let’s use those results to find the molar volume at 1 atm."
" \\ The method is molecular dynamics (MD), which tracks the motion of the"
" atoms."

#: ../../gas_laws/argon_molar_volume.rst:14
msgid "計算対象と計算条件"
msgstr "Systems and Calculation Conditions"

#: ../../gas_laws/argon_molar_volume.rst:16
msgid ""
"Arは原子が一つずつ独立に動く単原子気体です。\\ 今回の原子は、近づきすぎると反発し、少し離れたところで弱く引き合うモデルに従います。\\ "
"計算条件を :numref:`tab-argon-conditions` にまとめます。\\ 力場の数値パラメータ、入力構造、解析の手順は "
":doc:`reproduction` で確認できます。"
msgstr ""
"Ar is a monatomic gas whose atoms move individually. \\ In our model, the"
" atoms repel one another at very short distances and attract one another "
"weakly at somewhat larger distances. \\ The calculation conditions are "
"summarized in :numref:`tab-argon-conditions`. \\ The numerical force "
"field parameters, input structures, and analysis steps are available in "
":doc:`reproduction`."

